      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAVOONGA (4) bounced off her good first-up second with a commanding victory over 1350m here. Has further upside and gets every chance again from the good draw. MY COUNTRY BOY (2) shouldered the 59kg third up for a gritty Maiden win over 1630m at this course. Has the ability to overcome the wide gate and play a leading role. ITALUS (5) sat on the speed and battled on okay into second place last time out over 1800m at Bathurst. Rates an each way hope. SMICHOV (3) jumped sharply in trip with a solid on-pace second over 1800m at Bathurst. Comes here deep into the prep and deserves another chance in this company. ORANGE TSUNAMI (1) finally got off the mark at start seven with a dominant on speed win over 1500m at Goulburn. Adkins sticks and he looks up to this..",
